# npm Registry Configuration Template
# 
# By default (no changes needed), this file uses the public NPM registry.
# 
# To use a different registry, copy this file to .npmrc and uncomment ONE of the examples below.
# The .npmrc file is in .gitignore to prevent accidental credential commits.
# It is only used during Docker build and is not included in the final image.

# ============================================================================
# DEFAULT: Public NPM Registry (no configuration needed)
# ============================================================================
# Just build as-is. No changes required.

# ============================================================================
# EXAMPLE 1: Internal/Private NPM Registry (NO authentication required)
# ============================================================================
# Uncomment if your internal repo doesn't require authentication:
# registry=https://artifactory.example.com/artifactory/api/npm/npm-vir/

# ============================================================================
# EXAMPLE 2: Internal/Private NPM Registry (WITH authentication token)
# ============================================================================
# Uncomment if your internal repo requires authentication, and replace username/token:
# registry=https://artifactory.example.com/artifactory/api/npm/npm-vir/
# //artifactory.example.com/artifactory/api/npm/npm-vir/:_authToken=TOKEN